The colour picker levels up: drag to keep picking as you move, and a new Frame/Layer toggle chooses whether you sample the whole picture or just the active layer. Semi-transparent palette swatches now show a split view — solid colour and true transparency at a glance — and the primary swatch adapts to portrait and landscape. The brush Shape toggle now uses compact circle/square icons, and the toolbar defaults to 2 rows on every device. Thanks for testing Makapix Club!
